{"text": "September 18, 1974\nT4-0369-03 9F\n\nMr. D. A, Cummins\n\n___KOOL PORTFOLIO RECALL,\n\nThis reports portfolio recall results following immediate\nexposure to Kool \"Waterfall.\" (\"Waterfall\" was tested along\n\nwith Salem alternate campaign executions.)\n\nResults suggest the current Kool ads, as exemplified by \"Waterfall,\"\nare about as effective in terms of impact and communication as\ncurrent Salem ads from the \"Refreshes Naturally\" campaign.\n\n\u2018The average immediate recall score for Kool \"Waterfall\" was 56%\ncompared to 58% for Salem \"Refreshes Naturally.\" However, men\nhad marginally higher recall and younger smokers had significantly\nhigher recall of \"Refreshes Naturally.\"\n\n1 SEX, AGE\nH Under 35 &\nTotal Men Women _35 Older\ney 8 Ly fy %\nKool \"Waterfall\" 56 i 55 56 60 49\nSalem \u201cRefreshes Naturally\" 58 62 56 68 47\n\nNet visual and salesmessage playback was about equal for \"Waterfall\"\nand \"Refreshes Naturally.\"\n\n\u201cRefreshe:\nNaturally\u2019\n5\nSituation/Visual Net 55\nSalesmessage Net 50 53\nSelected Salesmessages\nCool /cooiness 35 31,\nFresh/refreshing 29 38]\nTaste 17 13\n\"Come Up To Kools\"/\n\"Refreshes Naturally\" cy 4\nPleasant/pleasurable 7\nMild/light 5\nNatural/natural menthol ce)\n= Significant Difference\nc. E. Poston\nCEP/nk\nec: Mr. F. H. Christopher, Jr. Mr. L, W. Hall, Jr.\nMr. J. F. Hind Mr. R. M. Powers\nMr. J. 'T. Winebrenner Ms. Margaret Daniels\nMr. A. P. Ritchy Ms. Ellen Monahan\nMr. J. H. Sherrill, Jr. Ms. Kay McCaffrey\nMr. D. W. Tredennick Ms. Susan Holt\n\nMe WA SnaaZT. HN. Savlor. \u201cLibrary \\\n\n3300S\n\nvint", "words": [{"text": "September", "x0": 310, "y0": 30, "x1": 386, "y1": 42, "conf": 92.0}, {"text": "18,", "x0": 397, "y0": 30, "x1": 419, "y1": 41, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "1974", "x0": 432, "y0": 29, "x1": 464, "y1": 39, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "T4-0369-03", "x0": 95, "y0": 45, "x1": 265, "y1": 69, "conf": 8.0}, {"text": "9F", "x0": 238, "y0": 41, "x1": 267, "y1": 75, 